OL,3,GNEWSALate reader to literary legend:
OL,4,ANick Butterworth inspires pupils to
OL,5,Aread
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn award-winning children's author who
OL,8,Fsaid he could not read until the age of
OL,9,Feight visited a school library to
OL,10,Finspire children to take up reading.
OL,12,FPercy the Park Keeper creator Nick
OL,13,FButterworth, 80, had previously
OL,14,Fauctioned off artwork to raise money
OL,15,Ffor a library at Lionwood Infant School
OL,16,Fin Norwich, Norfolk, a few years ago.
OL,18,FIn his latest visit, he said: "I just
OL,19,Fbelieve in libraries for schools, so
OL,20,Fmany schools have lost libraries, and
OL,21,Fso I wanted to support them."
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
