OL,3,GNEWSALate reader to literary legend:
OL,4,ANick Butterworth inspires pupils to
OL,5,Aread
OL,6,
OL,7,FButterworth said they had transformed
OL,8,Fthe "uninspiring room" into a room that
OL,9,F"kids want to come in and immerse
OL,10,Fthemselves in stories".
